@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100/api
@playerId = 1

### Stored source status only; never contacts upstream services
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerId}}/enrichment?includeData=false
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Stored source JSON snapshots
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerId}}/enrichment
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Explicit fetch; WoWProgress returns pending for the local collector
POST {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerId}}/enrichment
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Repeat refresh: 409 while active, otherwise 429 with Retry-After during cooldown
POST {{baseUrl}}/players/{{playerId}}/enrichment
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Missing player: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/2147483647/enrichment
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Memory-only pending status; safe to poll without waking PostgreSQL
GET {{baseUrl}}/wowprogress/jobs/pending/{{playerId}}
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Collector claim: 200 with a three-minute lease, or 204 when idle
POST {{baseUrl}}/wowprogress/jobs/claim
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}

### Cached listing uploaded by the home collector
GET {{baseUrl}}/wowprogress/discoveries
X-Api-Key: {{$processEnv SUPER_RECRUITER_API_KEY}}